try as="geometry" x="72" y="187" width="2468" height="35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel-title1-0" value="A  대안 구조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1336" y="187" width="1204" height="35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-0" value="박스: Component, 서브시스템, 논리 실행체 또는 저장소 이름 / 번호 화살표: 동작과 순서 / 검정: 공통 / 파랑: 달라지는 구조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1324" width="2492" height="28" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-note-0" value="차이: Streaming ASR와 Omni가 서로 다른 실행 경로에서 근거를 만든다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="88" y="1242" width="2452" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-note-1" value="Omni 장애 중에도 독립 전사는 계속될 수 있지만 의미 이해와 Voice 생성은 불가하다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="88" y="1270" width="2452" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-absent-0" value="독립 Speech Input Worker 없음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="632" width="1188" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-absent-1" value="인식과 의미 처리가 같은 runtime의 실행 기회와 장애 경계를 공유한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="660" width="1188" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-note-0" value="차이: 별도 ASR weights와 실행체를 제거한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="1242" width="1188" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-note-1" value="Omni 장애 중 capture는 계속되지만 recognition도 중단되며 gap을 남겨야 한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="1270" width="1188" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="common-0" value="공통: capture와 local stop은 추론 밖에서 계속된다. 공유 Omni weights는 한 벌이며 Voice와 semantic session의 상태 및 권한은 격리한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1360" width="2492" height="27" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
